# Secrets. AGENTS.md section 12: never commit .env, credentials or dumps of real data.
# .env.example is the one exception: it holds placeholders only (section 8.2).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# deno.lock is deliberately NOT ignored: it pins the exact dependency versions that section 2 requires.
node_modules/
coverage/
# deno.lock is the only lockfile: an npm one appears when an npm command runs here by mistake.
package-lock.json

# Claude Code: settings.json is shared, settings.local.json is a personal override.
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
